00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:10.661
The middle is three.

00:03:10.661 --> 00:03:12.997
The large outer one is worth two.

00:03:12.997 --> 00:03:15.917
You're gonna get five
attempts, and every punt,

00:03:15.917 --> 00:03:18.211
